1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,800
I heard cheering from the toaster.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,600
It wasn't making toast.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,900
It was a boxing match.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,500
Wheat bread was winning.

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,500
Then dark rye switched hands.

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,400
One punch.

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,800
White bread went down.

8
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,000
The toaster dinged.

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,500
The winner came out.

10
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,600
Should I eat the winner?
